1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,100
Two women. Same breast cancer, same treatment.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,500
Helsinki: 9 minutes from the hospital. Home every night.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,100
Utsjoki: her nearest radiotherapy unit is in Oulu…

4
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,500
…676 km away. Over 9 hours each way.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,500
15 sessions: 16 nights away from home.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Same cancer, different distance. 89 municipalities are more than 100 km from their unit.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,300
Lever 1 · Breast, eligible patients (no nodal radiotherapy)

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,500
5 sessions in one week: at least as good as 15 over three weeks.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,000
FAST-Forward trial: 4,096 patients, 10-year results.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Utsjoki: 16 nights away become 6.

11
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:46,000
Finland: about 17,500 machine sessions freed a year. Goal 3: treatment within target times.

12
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Lever 2 · Painful bone metastases: one 8 Gy session relieves pain as well as a longer course.

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
More retreatment, and the model counts it. Nights away still fall: 6.2 → 2.4.

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,500
Yet in a Turku study, only 7% of end-of-life courses were single sessions.

15
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:08,000
All of Finland. Height = nights away per patient. The north and east carry it.

16
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
5 sessions: 16 nights become 6.

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,000
The national roadmap notes palliative radiotherapy is used less beyond 100 km.

18
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,500
AI read the units' public patient pages. Every quote is checked against the page.

19
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:28,500
Only 1 of 12 units publishes which schedule it uses. So today's mix is an assumption you can set.

20
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:35,500
A memo for every county. Lapland: no unit, 20 of 21 municipalities beyond 100 km.

21
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:41,900
3 proposals, each with an owner and a first step within 30 days. 9 of 9 numbers traced.
